Two-block rewrite (replaces the single-block And composition, which
materialized setcc+movzbl+and+test — 50 insns vs 45 baseline):

  B1: sub = (i32)x - lo ; CondBranch (u32)sub > span -> MISS, B2
  B2: bit = BitTest MASK, sub ; CondBranch bit -> JOIN, MISS (mode A)
                              ; Branch JOIN, phi gets bit  (mode B,
