ZERO materialization — no setc/movzx/test. x86-64 hook prefers register
homes for mask and index (falls back to %rax/%rcx staging); i686 twin
uses %eax/%ecx staging with direct-register preference. The i686
never-materialized mirror (build_folded_value_set) includes fused
BitTests so their booleans get no stack home. xml_name_continue:
45 -> 42 insns, bt clusters branch directly ('btq %r10,%rax; jnc').

